{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And from there, the Well.</b> From there the slope came to the Well. How? The Holy One, blessed be He, said: Who will inform My children of these miracles? The parable says: ״You gave bread to a baby — it informs its mother.״ After they passed, the mountains returned to their place, and the Well descended into the streambed and from there brought up the blood of the slain, and arms and limbs, and carried them around the camp; and Israel saw and sang a song."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:11:56.511211522Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}